    {
      "standard": "cisa-2026",
      "name": "CISA 2026 Minimum Elements",
      "applicable": true,
      "compliant": false,
      "score": 7,
      "counts": {
        "error": 9,
        "warning": 3,
        "info": 0
      },
      "violations": [
        {
          "finding_id": "sbomtools:v1:c121631bf022b328",
          "finding_key": "cisa-2026|SBOM-CISA2026-AUTHOR|document",
          "severity": "Error",
          "category": "DocumentMetadata",
          "message": "[CISA 2026] SBOM Author missing: no Person or Organization creator names the entity that created the SBOM data (tool-only creator lists do not satisfy the element — the author is the entity operating the tool, not the tool itself)",
          "element": null,
          "requirement": "CISA 2026 Minimum Elements: SBOM Author",
          "rule_id": "SBOM-CISA2026-AUTHOR",
          "sarif_rule_id": "SBOM-CISA2026-AUTHOR",
          "standard_refs": [
            {
              "standard": "CisaMinimum2026",
              "id": "SBOM Author",
              "help_uri": "https://www.cisa.gov/resources-tools/resources/2026-minimum-elements-software-bill-materials-sbom"
            }
          ],
          "remediation": "Add a Person or Organization creator naming the entity that created the SBOM data — the entity operating the generation tool, not the tool itself, so tool-only creator lists do not satisfy the element. Use full names, no acronyms. CycloneDX: add metadata.authors[] (name, email) or metadata.manufacturer (name, contact[].email); metadata.tools entries do not count.",
          "help_uri": "https://www.cisa.gov/resources-tools/resources/2026-minimum-elements-software-bill-materials-sbom"
        },
        {
          "finding_id": "sbomtools:v1:a8f36f3ede2cbd0f",
          "finding_key": "cisa-2026|SBOM-CISA2026-SIGNATURE|document",
          "severity": "Warning",
          "category": "DocumentMetadata",
          "message": "[CISA 2026] No SBOM Author Signature found in the document (CycloneDX JSF signature or SPDX 3 verifiedUsing signature); SPDX 2.x cannot express one in-document and detached signatures are invisible to this check",
          "element": null,
          "requirement": "CISA 2026 Minimum Elements: SBOM Author Signature",
          "rule_id": "SBOM-CISA2026-SIGNATURE",
          "sarif_rule_id": "SBOM-CISA2026-SIGNATURE",
          "standard_refs": [
            {
              "standard": "CisaMinimum2026",
              "id": "SBOM Author Signature",
              "help_uri": "https://www.cisa.gov/resources-tools/resources/2026-minimum-elements-software-bill-materials-sbom"
            }
          ],
          "remediation": "Sign the SBOM with a digital signature attributable to the SBOM author, using an algorithm approved per NIST DSS, ISO/IEC 14888-4:2024, or the ENISA Agreed Cryptographic Mechanisms. Detached signatures are invisible to this check, and not every format can carry one in-document — hence Warning, not Error. SPDX 2.x has no in-document signature field, so the rule is not evaluated for SPDX 2.x documents. CycloneDX: sign the BOM: in JSON, a JSF signature object (algorithm and value) at the document root; in XML, an enveloped XML-DSig <Signature> element on <bom>.",
          "help_uri": "https://www.cisa.gov/resources-tools/resources/2026-minimum-elements-software-bill-materials-sbom"
        },
        {
          "finding_id": "sbomtools:v1:98b748f2ca790daf",
          "finding_key": "cisa-2026|SBOM-CISA2026-GENERATION-CONTEXT|document",
          "severity": "Warning",
          "category": "DocumentMetadata",
          "message": "[CISA 2026] SBOM Generation Context missing: no software lifecycle phase is declared (CycloneDX 1.5+ metadata.lifecycles, e.g. 'pre-build', 'build', 'post-build'; SPDX 2.x has no standard field)",
          "element": null,
          "requirement": "CISA 2026 Minimum Elements: SBOM Generation Context",
          "rule_id": "SBOM-CISA2026-GENERATION-CONTEXT",
          "sarif_rule_id": "SBOM-CISA2026-GENERATION-CONTEXT",
          "standard_refs": [
            {
              "standard": "CisaMinimum2026",
              "id": "SBOM Generation Context",
              "help_uri": "https://www.cisa.gov/resources-tools/resources/2026-minimum-elements-software-bill-materials-sbom"
            }
          ],
          "remediation": "Declare the lifecycle phase the SBOM was generated in — 'before build', 'build', 'after build', or a more specific identifier. Warning, not Error: not every format can carry the phase. SPDX 2.x has no standard field for it, so the rule is not evaluated for SPDX 2.x documents. CycloneDX: set metadata.lifecycles[].phase, e.g. build (the first entry is read).",
          "help_uri": "https://www.cisa.gov/resources-tools/resources/2026-minimum-elements-software-bill-materials-sbom"
        },
        {
          "finding_id": "sbomtools:v1:237e61efe1f7dfd4",
          "finding_key": "cisa-2026|SBOM-CISA2026-PRODUCER|test-app",
          "severity": "Error",
          "category": "SupplierInfo",
          "message": "[CISA 2026] Component 'test-app' names no producer (author/originator, manufacturer or supplier) and is not explicitly marked as of unknown provenance",
          "element": "test-app",
          "component_id": "test-app",
          "requirement": "CISA 2026 Minimum Elements: Component Producer",
          "rule_id": "SBOM-CISA2026-PRODUCER",
          "sarif_rule_id": "SBOM-CISA2026-PRODUCER",
          "standard_refs": [
            {
              "standard": "CisaMinimum2026",
              "id": "Component Producer",
              "help_uri": "https://www.cisa.gov/resources-tools/resources/2026-minimum-elements-software-bill-materials-sbom"
            }
          ],
          "remediation": "Identify each component's producer (the 2026 rename of the ambiguous Supplier Name): the entity that created the component is preferred, its supplier or manufacturer is accepted; if no clear producer exists, explicitly mark the component as of unknown provenance. File-type entries are exempt. CycloneDX: set components[].supplier.name (or manufacturer.name, or authors[].name).",
          "help_uri": "https://www.cisa.gov/resources-tools/resources/2026-minimum-elements-software-bill-materials-sbom"
        },
        {
          "finding_id": "sbomtools:v1:17ed5a828034d7b5",
          "finding_key": "cisa-2026|SBOM-CISA2026-IDENTIFIER|test-app",
          "severity": "Error",
          "category": "ComponentIdentification",
          "message": "[CISA 2026] Component 'test-app' has no machine-processable identifier (CPE or PURL are named by the element; SWHID/SWID also qualify)",
          "element": "test-app",
          "component_id": "test-app",
          "requirement": "CISA 2026 Minimum Elements: Component Identifiers",
          "rule_id": "SBOM-CISA2026-IDENTIFIER",
          "sarif_rule_id": "SBOM-CISA2026-IDENTIFIER",
          "standard_refs": [
            {
              "standard": "CisaMinimum2026",
              "id": "Component Identifiers",
              "help_uri": "https://www.cisa.gov/resources-tools/resources/2026-minimum-elements-software-bill-materials-sbom"
            }
          ],
          "remediation": "Add at least one common machine-processable identifier per component — the document names CPE and PURL (ECMA-427); UUIDs, organization-specific identifiers, commit hashes, and intrinsic identifiers (OmniBOR, SWHID / ISO/IEC 18670:2025) also qualify. Include all known identifiers. CycloneDX: set components[].purl (or cpe, or swhid[]).",
          "help_uri": "https://www.cisa.gov/resources-tools/resources/2026-minimum-elements-software-bill-materials-sbom"
        },
        {
          "finding_id": "sbomtools:v1:9d8266cde530b4f9",
          "finding_key": "cisa-2026|SBOM-CISA2026-HASH|test-app",
          "severity": "Error",
          "category": "IntegrityInfo",
          "message": "[CISA 2026] Component 'test-app' carries no cryptographic hash of the executable component artifact (explicitly indicate the value is unknown when the artifact is not available to the SBOM author)",
          "element": "test-app",
          "component_id": "test-app",
          "requirement": "CISA 2026 Minimum Elements: Component Hash Value",
          "rule_id": "SBOM-CISA2026-HASH",
          "sarif_rule_id": "SBOM-CISA2026-HASH",
          "standard_refs": [
            {
              "standard": "CisaMinimum2026",
              "id": "Component Hash Value",
              "help_uri": "https://www.cisa.gov/resources-tools/resources/2026-minimum-elements-software-bill-materials-sbom"
            }
          ],
          "remediation": "Provide an ASCII-hexadecimal cryptographic hash of each executable component artifact; when the SBOM author lacks access to the artifact, explicitly indicate the value is unknown. CycloneDX: add components[].hashes[] entries with alg SHA-256, SHA-384 or SHA-512 and the content.",
          "help_uri": "https://www.cisa.gov/resources-tools/resources/2026-minimum-elements-software-bill-materials-sbom"
        },
        {
          "finding_id": "sbomtools:v1:9942ba05bb3e949d",
          "finding_key": "cisa-2026|SBOM-CISA2026-LICENSE|test-app",
          "severity": "Error",
          "category": "LicenseInfo",
          "message": "[CISA 2026] Component 'test-app' has no license information and no explicit unknown indication (prefer SPDX identifiers; use NOASSERTION when the license is unknown to the author)",
          "element": "test-app",
          "component_id": "test-app",
          "requirement": "CISA 2026 Minimum Elements: Component License",
          "rule_id": "SBOM-CISA2026-LICENSE",
          "sarif_rule_id": "SBOM-CISA2026-LICENSE",
          "standard_refs": [
            {
              "standard": "CisaMinimum2026",
              "id": "Component License",
              "help_uri": "https://www.cisa.gov/resources-tools/resources/2026-minimum-elements-software-bill-materials-sbom"
            }
          ],
          "remediation": "Declare each component's license(s), preferring machine-processable SPDX license identifiers; a LicenseRef-* expression or a pointer to where the full license details are available also satisfies the element, and an explicit unknown (NOASSERTION) is required when the author is unaware. Silent absence fails. CycloneDX: add components[].licenses[] entries (license.id with an SPDX identifier, or an expression).",
          "help_uri": "https://www.cisa.gov/resources-tools/resources/2026-minimum-elements-software-bill-materials-sbom"
        },
